MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

You need to modify your program so that the benchmark used can be selected as a command-line parameter. That is, running something like:

your.exe 1 113 734718556 benchmark1 --eas --localsearch 0 --alpha 2.92 --beta 3.06 --rho 0.6 --ants 8

will run your program using benchmark "benchmark1".

Then you write in instances.txt the different benchmarks. They do not need to be separate instance files, just some string that your.exe can recognize and then select the appropriate benchmark to run.

Cheers,

Manuel.

