Hello Rahul,

If you have already use irace before, the same configuration files are valid for irace 3.0 so you have to just install it.

To install it, download the file in the previous post. If you have linux you can execute this directly in a terminal:

R CMD INSTALL <path_to_download>/irace_3.0.tar.gz

otherwise either in windows or linux you can execute this in the command line of R:

install.packages("<path_to_download>/irace_3.0.tar.gz", repos=NULL)

This way you will have the new version installed. To check this you can load the package in R and execute:

library("irace")
irace.version

Let us know if you encounter any problem and thanks for trying the new version out!

Bests,
Leslie.

